# HB-NONE (remake phase 1, 2026-10-11): the generated hitboxes were removed on purpose; animation, sound, movement and timing stay.
# The owner authors this move's hitbox by hand in the Workbench; its strike window is gameplay.json "strike" (timing metadata only).
# COMBO (geno 11): XV2 heavy finisher after light hit 5. Clip GOK_ATC_013 = BAC GOK_PLAYER 310 (BCM 0/18/3/3/3/3/3, OnAttackHit).
# BAC hit f10 dur 4. Limb: foot.R +11.34 Z at f10. The XV2 follow-ups (311 teleport rush with homing, 312, 480) are dropped: homing
# and lock-on are not built (approved: no auto-tracking).
PUT ANIM_RATE 1.0
# XV2 BAC Movement event f1 dur 10 (BAC 310 (its second, 10-frame record)); the step is GROUND_VEL x FACING, a design speed (the BAC record's speed is not decoded)
wait_until 1
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.1
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 6
GET ra_f:0 FACING
MUL ra_f:0 1.1
PUT GROUND_VEL ra_f:0
wait_until 10
wait_until 11
PUT GROUND_VEL 0
wait_until 14
wait_until 35
iasa
